=== la-signal-gen opt1 for the RP2350 logic analyzer ===
all levels are 3.3 V, connect the grounds of both boards
tie GPIO 23 to GPIO 25 with a jumper so MISO shows the same bytes as MOSI
status:
  SQ      GPIO 4  1000 Hz hardware (asked 1000 Hz), 50 % duty
  GPIO25  reserved for SPI MISO (SQ2 disabled)
  PAT0-3  GPIO 13,14,16,17  12.5/25/37.5/50 % duty, same period
  I2C     GPIO 18 SCL, 19 SDA  100 kHz, write 68 reg 01 data 5A
  SPI     GPIO 21 CS, 22 SCK, 23 MOSI, 25 MISO  1000000 Hz, frame DE AD BE EF 00 01 02 03
  UART    GPIO 26 TX at 115200 baud, sending "LA1234\n" at scheduler tick intervals when independent
  CAN     GPIO 32 TX @250 kbps, ID 0x123, data DE AD BE EF (incrementing)
  stress  0 Hz, CAN queued=1 errors=0, SPI errors=0
  mode    burst: all four protocols together every 100 ms

